{"id":"6b59cd8224fced06","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-fun-graph-of-function.md","title":"ZFC Fun Graph Of Function","display":"df-zfc-fun-graph-of-function — ZFC Fun Graph Of Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-fun-graph-of-function","aliases":["58-df-zfc-fun-graph-of-function"],"display":"df-zfc-fun-graph-of-function — ZFC Fun Graph Of Function","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-fun-graph-of-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-fun-graph-of-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-fun-graph-of-function — ZFC Fun Graph Of Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,G,A,B\">\\(f,G,A,B\\)</span> (set parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFunGraphOfFunction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFunGraphOfFunction}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}fun\\text{-}graph\\text{-}of\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFunGraphOfFunction}_S(G,f)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists A\\,\\exists B\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\\land G=f\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}fun\\text{-}graph\\text{-}of\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFunGraphOfFunction}_S(G,f)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists A\\,\\exists B\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\\land G=f\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>在 ZFC 的集合论编码中，函数本身就是其有序对图；原来的无限制集合构造会把未限定定义域的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x)\">\\(f(x)\\)</span> 当作处处有定义。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)$ (function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,G,A,B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFunGraphOfFunction}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}fun\\text{-}graph\\text{-}of\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFunGraphOfFunction}_S(G,f)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists A\\,\\exists B\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\\land G=f\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"f(x)","display":false}],"bytes":938,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2137","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-fun-graph-of-function.md|58-df-zfc-fun-graph-of-function]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751"]}